summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"https://getpsalm.org/r/6bcd7e9271\r\n```php\r\n<?php\r\n  namespace NS;\r\n  use Countable;\r\n\r\n  class Item {}\r\n  /**\r\n   * @var iterable<Item>&Countable $collection\r\n   */\r\n  $collection = [];\r\n  count($collection);\r\n\r\n  /**\r\n   * @param iterable<Item>&Countable $collection\r\n   */\r\n  function mycount($collection): int {    \r\n      return count($collection);\r\n  }\r\n  mycount($collection);\r\n```\r\nNone of the above should fail, as far as I understand, but psalm reports this:\r\n```\r\nERROR: InvalidArgument - 10:9 - Argument 1 of count expects array<mixed, mixed>|Countable, iterable<NS\\Item, NS\\&Countable> provided\r\n\r\nERROR: UndefinedClass - 13:13 - Class or interface NS\\ does not exist\r\n\r\nERROR: InvalidArgument - 17:20 - Argument 1 of count expects array<mixed, mixed>|Countable, iterable<NS\\Item, NS\\&Countable> provided\r\n```\r\nNote the `iterable<NS\\Item, NS\\&Countable> provided` part. Here, `Countable` shouldn't be a part of iterable type params, and `NS\\&Countable` is not even a type.\r\n\r\n**Edit**: This is namespace resolution issue. [Similar test case](https://github.com/vimeo/psalm/blob/392f3194c005ae09095ae97c5e07c6abf97982ee/tests/ForeachTest.php#L42) in the global namespace works just fine, but [fails if you put it into a namespace](https://getpsalm.org/r/bc6917797e).","closed_by":{"login":"muglug","id":2292638,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyOTI2Mzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2292638?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug","html_url":"https://github.com/muglug","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muglug/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vimeo/psalm/issues/706/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}